# The Movie Database (TMDB) API Key
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.themoviedb.org/
# 2. Go to Settings > API and generate a v3 API Key
# 3. Paste your API key below and rename this file to .env
# Note: The app also includes offline curated fallback demo data if no API key is provided!
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here
